    "detailed_description": "In this heartwarming adventure game, you play as a lonely protagonist who downloads a friendship-making app, only to be transported to a beautiful tropical island. But things take a turn when you discover that others have also been transported there, and they are in danger! To save them, you must navigate through a treacherous cave filled with monsters, befriending them along the way to help you on your quest. With each new friend, you'll discover more about the island's secrets and uncover a mystery that will keep you hooked until the very end. Get ready for a fun and emotional journey filled with friendship, danger, and discovery in this one-of-a-kind game!<br><br><strong>Voice acting<br>Original art<br>Original soundtrack</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984550/extras/1d3964ad5a37b60837b5c8085bf5420a.poster.avif?t=1680422958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984550/extras/1d3964ad5a37b60837b5c8085bf5420a.webm?t=1680422958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984550/extras/1d3964ad5a37b60837b5c8085bf5420a.mp4?t=1680422958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Walk around and explore :)<br><br>Battle system is more of a friend system!<br><br>Controls:<br>Walk: Arrow keys or WASD or click<br>Interact: Space, enter or click<br>Controller: D-PAD to walk and a to interact",
